  "id": "activity-rhythm",
  "term": "activity rhythm",
  "definition": "Activity rhythm, in this context, refers to the daily pattern of movement and rest across a 24-hour period, including times of physical activity, inactivity, and sleep. It can also describe how fragmented this pattern is within a day and how consistent it is from one day to the next.",
